        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gems &amp; Tarot</i> is a strategic game that blends the fun of match-3 puzzles with deep deck-building. Here, your carefully crafted deck guides your every match, and each chain reaction brings hope for a breakthrough. Master the unique card-building and progression system to overcome increasingly tricky stages; complete hidden objectives to unlock gems with extraordinary powers and forge your own unique playstyle. It’s not just a battle of wits—it’s a dance with luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/ad020c9d17756342cbace3a39b4a1442.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/dce5fdcc90c6bbcfa21f732bc38b25b3.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🃏 Deep Deck-Building</strong><br>Earn coins through engaging match-3 challenges and visit the shop to carefully select from 22 uniquely powerful Tarot cards. Each card can be upgraded across 3 levels, and the vast array of combinations allows for endless strategic possibilities—making every run feel fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/f9b5a971dcabfc1a95a14bcbb352c669.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/c9fc5aed1c96159ece1b84ed0652b3db.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💎 Unlock Legendary Gems</strong><br>Complete in-game achievements to unlock new gems with special abilities. Each gem can fundamentally reshape your strategy, paving the way for a playstyle that is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/8b57fd63bc4a759b3a9a009b1033d106.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 Challenge the Highest Scores</strong><br>Use your wits, embrace a bit of luck, and continuously refine your ultimate deck as you aim for new high scores. Every playthrough is a new adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152840/extras/b193b3dbb1b85e185e0908f0c1b2a6d9.avif?t=1765974613\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start now and enjoy a magical and relaxing experience!</strong><br><strong>Gem &amp; Tarot — Easy to learn, endlessly fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
